# Serie de ejercicios – Unidad 3 (ejercicios 13 a 36)

## Inversa de matrices (ejercicios 13-20)

Método: A⁻¹ = (1/det A) · adj(A), donde adj(A) es la transpuesta de la matriz de cofactores.

### Ejercicio 13

A = [3 -4 -1; -1 2 2; -3 -1 2]

```
(3)(2)(2) + (-4)(2)(-3) + (-1)(-1)(-1) = 12 + 24 + -1 = 35
(-1)(2)(-3) + (3)(2)(-1) + (-4)(-1)(2) = 6 + -6 + 8 = 8
det = 35 - (8) = 27
```

Matriz de cofactores C = [6 -4 7; 9 3 15; -6 -5 2]

adj(A) = Cᵀ = [6 9 -6; -4 3 -5; 7 15 2]

**A⁻¹ = (1/27) · adj(A) = [2/9 1/3 -2/9; -4/27 1/9 -5/27; 7/27 5/9 2/27]**

### Ejercicio 14

A = [3 0 2; 4 5 -2; -1 -3 -4]

```
(3)(5)(-4) + (0)(-2)(-1) + (2)(4)(-3) = -60 + 0 + -24 = -84
(2)(5)(-1) + (3)(-2)(-3) + (0)(4)(-4) = -10 + 18 + 0 = 8
det = -84 - (8) = -92
```

Matriz de cofactores C = [-26 18 -7; -6 -10 9; -10 14 15]

adj(A) = Cᵀ = [-26 -6 -10; 18 -10 14; -7 9 15]

**A⁻¹ = (1/-92) · adj(A) = [13/46 3/46 5/46; -9/46 5/46 -7/46; 7/92 -9/92 -15/92]**

### Ejercicio 15

A = [-1 4 -4; 0 -3 4; 0 0 0]

```
(-1)(-3)(0) + (4)(4)(0) + (-4)(0)(0) = 0 + 0 + 0 = 0
(-4)(-3)(0) + (-1)(4)(0) + (4)(0)(0) = 0 + 0 + 0 = 0
det = 0 - (0) = 0
```

Como det A = 0, **la matriz no tiene inversa** (es singular).

