## Determinante por regla de Sarrus (ejercicios 21-22)

### Ejercicio 21

```
(-6)(4)(11) + (0)(-8)(10) + (-3)(3)(7) = -264 + 0 + -63 = -327
(-3)(4)(10) + (-6)(-8)(7) + (0)(3)(11) = -120 + 336 + 0 = 216
det = -327 - (216) = -543
```

**det = -543**

### Ejercicio 22

```
(10)(-2)(1) + (-5)(-1)(5) + (0)(7)(-3) = -20 + 25 + 0 = 5
(0)(-2)(5) + (10)(-1)(-3) + (-5)(7)(1) = 0 + 30 + -35 = -5
det = 5 - (-5) = 10
```

**det = 10**

